window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-023-8f7629102b65a62d.json"]={sha256:"8f7629102b65a62dc29009a202337622126929a93a519ee375242c386dae26d0",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-a3054099b553bbb6","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204","title":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","titleEn":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","publisher":"Rasmussen et al., PRX Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-023","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-023","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-024","referenceUrls":["https://research.ibm.com/publications/a-cryo-cmos-control-system-for-large-scale-superconducting-qubit-quantum-computing-part-2"],"title":"IBM Heron 控制鏈：取樣時鐘抖動與相位","titleEn":"IBM Heron control chain: sample-clock jitter and phase","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付光子／場振幅雙公式、排空曲線與時間窗驗收。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver separate photon/field laws, depletion curves and timing-window acceptance. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『IBM Heron 控制鏈：取樣時鐘抖動與相位』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付秒／週期／角度換算鏈與固定延遲／隨機抖動分類。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'IBM Heron control chain: sample-clock jitter and phase', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver time/cycle/angle conversions and fixed-delay/random-jitter classification.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：能量／光子數n(t)=n0 exp(−κt)；場振幅則以κ/2衰減，兩者不可混用。 使用合成κ=2π×2 MHz、n0=10、等待t=200 ns。 以手算或試算表計算名義式10*exp(-2*pi*2e6*200e-9)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以兩次200 ns衰減因子相乘重現400 ns結果；若誤用場振幅式將高估殘留。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：小時間抖動σt造成相位RMS σφ=2πfσt；只描述參考頻率上的小訊號抖動，不是總門誤差。 使用教學載波f=5 GHz、σt=1 ps；相位以rad量化。 以手算或試算表計算名義式2*pi*5e9*1e-12，另開一欄執行獨立核對：直接計算fσt的週期比例再乘360°；兩種路徑的角度應一致。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Energy/photon number n(t)=n0 exp(−κt); field amplitude decays atκ/2, so do not mix them. Use Synthetic κ=2π×2 MHz, n0=10 and wait t=200 ns. Evaluate nominal expression 10*exp(-2*pi*2e6*200e-9) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Multiply two200 ns decay factors to reproduce400 ns; using the field-amplitude law overestimates remaining photons.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Small timing jitter σt gives RMS phase σφ=2πfσt; this is a small-signal clock contribution, not total gate error. Use Teaching carrier f=5 GHz and σt=1 ps; express phase in rad. Evaluate nominal expression 2*pi*5e9*1e-12 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Compute fractional cycle fσt then multiply by360°; both calculation routes should agree.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-033","referenceUrls":["https://www.nist.gov/programs-projects/ion-traps"],"title":"NIST 表面阱：運動加熱率與等待時間","titleEn":"NIST surface trap: motional heating rate and wait time","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付光子／場振幅雙公式、排空曲線與時間窗驗收。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver separate photon/field laws, depletion curves and timing-window acceptance. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『NIST 表面阱：運動加熱率與等待時間』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付等待—聲子圖、斜率驗證及冷卻插入位置。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'NIST surface trap: motional heating rate and wait time', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver wait/phonon plots, slope verification and recooling insertion points.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：能量／光子數n(t)=n0 exp(−κt)；場振幅則以κ/2衰減，兩者不可混用。 使用合成κ=2π×2 MHz、n0=10、等待t=200 ns。 以手算或試算表計算名義式10*exp(-2*pi*2e6*200e-9)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以兩次200 ns衰減因子相乘重現400 ns結果；若誤用場振幅式將高估殘留。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：短時間常數加熱代理n̄(t)=n̄0+ṉt；不包括重新冷卻、模式耦合或非線性飽和。 使用教學n̄0=0.05、ṉ=10聲子/s、等待20 ms。 以手算或試算表計算名義式0.05+10*0.020，另開一欄執行獨立核對：從5與20 ms兩點斜率反算10聲子/s；時間必須先換成秒。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Energy/photon number n(t)=n0 exp(−κt); field amplitude decays atκ/2, so do not mix them. Use Synthetic κ=2π×2 MHz, n0=10 and wait t=200 ns. Evaluate nominal expression 10*exp(-2*pi*2e6*200e-9) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Multiply two200 ns decay factors to reproduce400 ns; using the field-amplitude law overestimates remaining photons.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Short-time constant-heating proxy n̄(t)=n̄0+ṉt excludes recooling, mode coupling and nonlinear saturation. Use Teaching n̄0=0.05, heating rate10 phonons/s and wait20 ms. Evaluate nominal expression 0.05+10*0.020 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Recover10 phonons/s from the5 and20 ms slope; convert time to seconds first.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-e29b871843904d5c","url":"https://research.ibm.com/publications/a-cryo-cmos-control-system-for-large-scale-superconducting-qubit-quantum-computing-part-2","title":"A Cryo-CMOS Control System for Large-Scale Superconducting Qubit Quantum Computing: Part 2","titleEn":"A Cryo-CMOS Control System for Large-Scale Superconducting Qubit Quantum Computing: Part 2","publisher":"IBM Research","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-4db98038249d8c33","url":"https://www.nist.gov/programs-projects/ion-traps","title":"Ion Traps","titleEn":"Ion Traps","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
